{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Twinkleby, you change the soundtrack as you build. Winter turns to spring, the backdrop changes from an archipelago of islands to a sky full of planets, day turns to night, and as the game world changes, so does the music. The Twinkleby soundtrack is made by Retro Family, who have composed 13 tracks that feature everything from in-game tunes like the Neighbour song, Molligan's theme and the Main Theme, as well as several tracks that combine season and time of day, to create a diverse track list of different tunes that are possible in-game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010920?t=1762262784","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010920?t=1762262784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010920/c89de1d6fcfee7cdf446f18ded96ac29e097994f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762262784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010920/c89de1d6fcfee7cdf446f18ded96ac29e097994f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762262784","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Twinkleby, you change the soundtrack as you build. Winter turns to spring, the backdrop changes from an archipelago of islands to a sky full of planets, day turns to night, and as the game world changes, so does the music. The Twinkleby soundtrack is made by Retro Family, who have composed 13 tracks that feature everything from in-game tunes like the Neighbour song, Molligan's theme and the Main Theme, as well as several tracks that combine season and time of day, to create a diverse track list of different tunes that are possible in-game.</p>","developers":["Might and Delight"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3362960","name":"Twinkleby"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010920/d478070a6c2509501402987a788